| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `state` | Simplified — `currentView` defaults to `null` |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `mutations` | Replaced `addView`/`updateView` with `upsertView`; `removeView` now takes plain string |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `actions.init` | Removed broken `$storex.store.subscribe` |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `actions` | All actions now correctly destructure `{ state }` from context |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `actions.deleteView` | Accepts plain `viewName` string, not object |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Modify | `actions.saveView` | Upserts returned view; consistent API accessor |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Add | `actions.saveCurrentView` | Convenience quick-save for current view |
| `client/src/store/views.js` | Remove | `actions.createDefaultView`, `autoSaveCurrentView`, `getProjectLastView` | Removed over-engineered auto-behaviours causing noise |

