## File 2: `client/src/components/main-menu/ViewsMenu.vue`

Key fixes:
- All `$storex.ui.views` → `$storex.views.views`
- `$storex.ui.lastView` → `$storex.views.lastView`
- `$storex.ui.saveView` → `$storex.views.saveCurrentView` or `saveView`
- `$storex.ui.loadView` → `$storex.views.loadView`
- `$storex.ui.deleteView(name)` → `$storex.views.deleteView(name)`
- ViewProperties modal for create/edit is in Desktop, trigger via `$storex.ui.openViewEditor`

```vue client/src/components/main-menu/ViewsMenu.vue
<script setup>
import {
  MenubarSub,
  MenubarSubContent,
  MenubarSubTrigger,
