## Summary of Root Causes Fixed

| Bug | Location | Fix |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Views read from wrong store namespace | `ViewsMenu.vue` | `$storex.ui.views` → `$storex.views.views` |
| `deleteView` called with string but expected object | `views.js` / `ViewsMenu.vue` | Unified to plain string parameter |
| Actions accessed `state` as closure variable (stale) | `views.js` | All actions use `{ state }` destructuring |
| `$storex.store.subscribe` doesn't exist | `views.js` | Removed; `onActiveProjectChanged` called explicitly |
| `@confirm` on ViewProperties did nothing (just closed) | `Desktop.vue` | `onViewConfirm` now calls `saveView` before closing |
| `upsertView` missing — save didn't update existing entries | `views.js` | Replaced `addView`/`updateView` with single `upsertView` |
| `saveCurrentView` not in views store | `views.js` | Added as dedicated action |

